ctionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"interaction","description":{"value":"<p>The Vanish Man doesn't have an alignment aura and cannot be detected by spells such as <em>detect alignment</em>.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!7ZXVIomj8aM8IK6F.2GPHZdvZjNrQX4S7"},{"_id":"eb5QTbp37dxuOa2K","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.kakyXBG5WA8c6Zfd"},"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Constant Spells","sort":1100000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"interaction","description":{"value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ConstantSpells]</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":"Pathfinder Bestiary"},"rules":[],"slug":"constant-spells","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!7ZXVIomj8aM8IK6F.eb5QTbp37dxuOa2K"},{"_id":"Vn8Ud2h9UUkYBpqn","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.hFtNbo1LKYCoDy2O"},"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Reaction.webp","name":"Attack of Opportunity","sort":1200000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"reaction"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","description":{"value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.AttackOfOpportunity]</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":"Pathfinder Bestiary"},"rules":[],"slug":"attack-of-opportunity","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!7ZXVIomj8aM8IK6F.Vn8Ud2h9UUkYBpqn"},{"_id":"iMfJOLJk4i8ywGZb","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.etMnv73EIdEZrYYu"},"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Frightful Presence","sort":1300000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","description":{"value":"<p>10 feet. @Check[will|dc:33|options:area-effect,inflicts:frightened]</p>\n<p>This aura is suppressed while the Vanish Man is using Change Shape.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.FrightfulPresence]</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":"Pathfinder Bestiary"},"rules":[{"key":"Aura","predicate":[{"not":"change-shape"}],"radius":10,"slug":"frightful-presence","traits":["emotion","fear","mental"]}],"slug":"frightful-presence","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["aura","emotion","fear","mental"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!7ZXVIomj8aM8IK6F.iMfJOLJk4i8ywGZb"},{"_id":"MWMoiiaCQn1JlcdB","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp","name":"Change Shape","sort":1400000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>The vanish man can take on the exact form of any Small, Medium, or Large humanoid whose face they carry in their bag of faces, changing their shape and physical features to precisely match that of the victim whose face they wear. This doesn't change the butcher's Speed or attack or damage bonuses with their Strikes.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","option":"change-shape","toggleable":true}],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["concentrate","occult","polymorph"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!7ZXVIomj8aM8IK6F.MWMoiiaCQn1JlcdB"},{"_id":"SaNPZ048iYwMkyBR","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp","name":"Remove Face","sort":1500000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":2},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The vanish man is within reach of a @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.yZRUzMqrMmfLu0V1]{Dying}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{Immobilized}, or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fBnFDH2MTzgFijKf]{Unconscious} creature</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The vanish man attempts a cleaver Strike or an @Check[athletics|defense:fortitude] check against the creature's Fortitude DC. On a success, the vanish man deals damage as if they had made a successful cleaver Strike against the creature and removes the creature's face. On a critical success, the damage doubles and the creature takes @Damage[4d6[bleed]]. Once its face is removed, the creature takes a permanent -4 status penalty to Charisma checks and Charisma-based skill checks. This penalty can be removed only if the victim recovers its face from the vanish man and has a @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.SnaLVgxZ9ryUFmUr]{Restoration} spell cast on it.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-effects.Item.NLjzI7gt6djXSoXc]{Effect: Remove Face}</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["attack"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!7ZXVIomj8aM8IK6F.SaNPZ048iYwMkyBR"},{"_id":"gb1r1Z5H5PiFdqyV","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp","name":"Sudden Slices","sort":1600000,"system":{"acti